# Lantern 9 — RetroOS small font (labels under icons, status text)
# (C) RetroOS contributors. Original drawing. License: SIL OFL 1.1.
#
# Proportional, regular weight: 1-pixel strokes (docs/STYLE.md §4). Same
# format as lantern-12.glyphs: "@ <hex codepoint> <name> [+<first row>]
# [w<width>]", then rows of '#' (ink) and '.' (paper), each as wide as the
# glyph including its one column of spacing on the right.
#
# Metrics: cell 9 rows. Cap height rows 1-6, x-height rows 3-6, baseline
# under row 6, descenders rows 7-8. Accented Latin-1 letters are composed
# (crates/retro-gfx/src/font/accents.rs).

